LegalEase – Project Planning Phase
1. Project Objective
To develop an AI-powered web application that helps users create, edit, and download legal document drafts easily and quickly.
2. Project Scope
Provide different legal document templates.
Collect user details through forms.
Generate customized document drafts using AI.
Allow users to edit and preview documents.
Provide document download and storage options.
Maintain user data securely.
3. Project Team
Project Manager: Plans and monitors the project.
Frontend Developer: Develops the website interface.
Backend Developer: Develops server-side functionality.
AI Developer: Integrates AI document generation.
Database Developer: Designs and manages the database.
Tester: Tests the application and fixes issues.
4. Development Plan
Phase	Activity
1	Requirement Analysis
2	Project Design
3	Frontend Development
4	Backend Development
5	AI Integration
6	Database Integration
7	Testing
8	Deployment
9	Maintenance
5. Resources Required
Computer/laptop
Internet connection
Code editor
Web browser
Database server
AI API
Web hosting
6. Risk Planning
AI errors: Validate and review generated drafts.
Data security: Use secure authentication and storage.
Technical errors: Perform regular testing.
API failure: Provide fallback templates.
Time delay: Divide development into smaller tasks.
7. Expected Outcome
A functional LegalEase website that enables users to generate and manage legal document drafts through an easy-to-use AI-assisted platform.
